          <commentary>지형학적 재난은 산사태 등이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>기상학적 재난</choice_text>
          <commentary>기상학적 재난이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
